{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00abLost Infinity\u00bb </strong>is a  non-linear visual novel with thriller elements. Heavy, oppressive atmosphere, bleak landscapes of the future, a sense of longing and alienation, with a small and false ray of hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/wishlist_english.png?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/gameplay-english_2.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of dystopia: what is it like, and why did it become this way? It doesn\u2019t matter much. What matters is who we remain within it: biological machines or humans. Here, there is no place for family, morality, or compassion. There is only the goal. A grand goal. But are we sure we know what we\u2019re striving for? Do we even need it? And when will we catch even a glimpse of this all-consuming infinity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/1201__3__1_.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character, <strong>Faith</strong>, wakes up in the evening in their apartment. An unknown desire pulls them outside today. There, they find the corpse of a beautiful girl. They had often come across dead bodies in this city before, but for some reason, today it felt wrong. Today, nothing will change. Today, nothing is certain. Today...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/dog-english.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original, dark soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Festering atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mesmerizing visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disturbing dystopian story</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2583530?t=1746282306","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746282306","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746282306","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746282306","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3513630,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00abLost Infinity\u00bb </strong>is a  non-linear visual novel with thriller elements. Heavy, oppressive atmosphere, bleak landscapes of the future, a sense of longing and alienation, with a small and false ray of hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/wishlist_english.png?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/gameplay-english_2.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of dystopia: what is it like, and why did it become this way? It doesn\u2019t matter much. What matters is who we remain within it: biological machines or humans. Here, there is no place for family, morality, or compassion. There is only the goal. A grand goal. But are we sure we know what we\u2019re striving for? Do we even need it? And when will we catch even a glimpse of this all-consuming infinity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/1201__3__1_.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main character, <strong>Faith</strong>, wakes up in the evening in their apartment. An unknown desire pulls them outside today. There, they find the corpse of a beautiful girl. They had often come across dead bodies in this city before, but for some reason, today it felt wrong. Today, nothing will change. Today, nothing is certain. Today...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/extras/dog-english.gif?t=1746282306\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original, dark soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Festering atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mesmerizing visual style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disturbing dystopian story</p></li></ul>","developers":["Void Echo"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2583530/header.jpg?t=1746282306","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2 GHz or faster processor<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><